Dialogue: 3,0:21:14.79,0:21:16.46,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HFCA1AE&}是那般不定
Dialogue: 3,0:21:16.46,0:21:17.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HFCA1AE&}那般幻想
Dialogue: 3,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HFCA1AE&}那般朦朧
Dialogue: 3,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HFCA1AE&}那般現實
Dialogue: 3,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDC9331&}孤獨一人的銀河 融入了這般一切
Dialogue: 3,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDC9331&}黑暗
Dialogue: 3,0:21:24.72,0:21:26.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDC9331&}前方
Dialogue: 3,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDC9331&}是未知的信號
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.81,0:21:33.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HEC8C8B&}你的一言一語之中 是掩蓋不住的躁動
Dialogue: 3,0:21:33.65,0:21:38.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HEC8C8B&}困惑 擔憂 通通嚥下 來吧
Dialogue: 3,0:21:38.48,0:21:45.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HAD8FE2&}從伸出之手的指尖 感受到強烈的共鳴
Dialogue: 3,0:21:47.49,0:21:55.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HF98EE6&}那以你為名的門中 璀璨光輝四面溢出
Dialogue: 3,0:21:56.38,0:22:04.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HF98EE6&}超越無盡明日未來 奔向遙遠天涯海角
Dialogue: 3,0:22:04.72,0:22:08.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&H9FC376&}超越邊界線的航海
Dialogue: 3,0:22:09.10,0:22:13.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HFFB3B9&}看吧 一定沒問題的 alright
Dialogue: 3,0:22:13.60,0:22:17.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HE57993&}連結與你共同的星座
